Cosmalia Live — Artix Linux (dinit)
===================================

Minimal COSMIC desktop: cosmic-comp + Noctalia, supervised by dinit.
You are logged in as 'liveuser' on vt1 (greetd autologin).
Logging out returns to greetd with a textual tuigreet prompt.

Root shell:           sudo -i
Session log:          cat "$XDG_RUNTIME_DIR/cosmalia-session.log"
Shell log:            dinitctl --user catlog noctalia
Boot/services:        dinitctl list
